<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63047" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐβάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λείβω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything that drips</i> or
				<i>trickles</i>, esp. <i>spring, fount, stream</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1215
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				534
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. νυμφαία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					52.13
				</span></i>
			; <i>standing water</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				24.6
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>streams</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβάσιν ὑδρηλαῖς . . πηγῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					613
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακρύων λιβάδες</span>
			<i>streams</i> of tears, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1106
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλακτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1735
				</span></i>
			; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραιὰ ἡ Αἴγυπτος καὶ ῥᾳδία
					λιβάδας διαδοῦναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ephor.
					65
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>: in pl., also of <i>pools of water</i> that collect after
			rain, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόνομοι λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					8.6.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.627
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				2.6.14
			</span></i>; of marshes, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.4.4
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβάζω</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>vessel that drips</i> when under the influence of heat, a
			rudimentary thermometer, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
